  booktitle={Proceedings of the 2010 ACM SIGMOD International Conference on Management of data},
  pages={135--146},
  year={2010},
  comments={Google Graph Processing
  SOLUTION: Pregel uses a bulk synchronous parallel programming style. A graph computation is broken up into a sequence of iterations. In each iteration, a vertex is able to (1) receive messages from the previous iteration, (2) do local computation or modify the graph, and (3) send messages to vertices that will be received in the next iteration.}
