  SOLUTIONS: `CARGA' framework that uses CSR fragmenting and limits all `random' accesses to the cache.
  METHODOLOGY: Uses CSR Fragmenting partion the graph into subgraphs that fit graph segments (subgraphs) into LLC}
}

